A||||39||gtsonly||Excuses for the Police||||6||
Z||000000||gtsonly||12-31-2000||05:04 PM||||So you just got nailed by the local Police for doing god knows what speed in your fiero, but a speed more than what is posted. So, what's the excuse you give the cop to get out of it? <P>Mine: Let me just call my lawyer, Johnny Cochran!!!<P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||6
Z||000001||Sndfr||12-31-2000||05:13 PM||||"I was keeping up with the flow of traffic and the nearest car is 50 yards ahead of me."  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/scorchio/sevil.gif">      <B>Matthew "Whyt Nyte" D.</B>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/scorchio/sgrin.gif">           <BR><B><I>84 SE</B>- automatic, rare Fender Delete option "Fender gap?  What fender gap?"</I><BR><B>(future owner of a 60's-70's Chevy muscle car)</B><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://sndfr.homestead.com/files/fender4profile.jpg"> ||||reg||6
